  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The original open-source artificial pancreas algorithm — community-built by and for people with Type 1 diabetes, with direct influence on FDA-cleared commercial APS systems. MIT licensed, 475 stars, 404 forks. Last formal release v0.7.1 (2022) reflects algorithmic maturity rather than abandonment; the broader DIY loop ecosystem (AndroidAPS, Loop) evolved from this foundation. Historically significant as a patient-empowerment project that reshaped the commercial insulin delivery landscape.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
